Changes and attribution
-----------------------
The package reshapes, subsets, and caches source material for discovery,
illustration, and regression testing. It preserves source identifiers and
labels where available. These changes are the package maintainer's work and
do not imply endorsement by NSO. Reusers should attribute the National
Statistics Office of Mongolia, link the source and applicable license, state
any further changes, and verify current data before publication.
